        Uq (n + 2) ≤ 23 / 10 * Uq (n + 1) - 1 / 4 ∧
        V (DU (n + 1)) (DU (n + 2)) (DU (n + 3)) (DU (n + 4)) (DU (n + 5)) (DU (n + 6)) (DU (n + 7)) (DU (n + 8)) (DU (n + 9)) (DU (n + 10)) ≤
